Type: Package
Title: Simple Image Filters
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Johan Lorentz
Maintainer: Johan Lorentz <change.this@email.com>
Description: A small package for applying simple image filters to bitmap images. The package contains pixel functions for greyscale, red, green, blue and cutoff filters, and functions for applying these filters to an image.
